WEBVTT

00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:13,490
I've been reading through the manual and have not found an answer for the question,

00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:20,690
how long should I use the day time frequencies? Well, the day frequencies that I put in your

00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:27,730
folder, I'm pretty much everybody has day frequencies in their folders and they're just to use

00:00:27,730 --> 00:00:33,010
if you have time. There are some people that never use them, there are some people that do it every day.

00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:41,090
So I certainly, if you're feeling great and you've improved and you've got your

00:00:41,810 --> 00:00:46,130
energy back, I'd rather have you outside, gardening and living your life and

00:00:47,490 --> 00:00:54,530
playing with your kids or your grandkids than having to sit at the rice machine. But if you

00:00:54,530 --> 00:01:01,090
are going to sit down and read a book or study or watch TV or something like that, then turn on one

00:01:01,090 --> 00:01:08,690
of your day programs.

